<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f8f7f3">
  <meta name="description" content="Temukan pilihan fashion dan lifestyle pilihan di NARA. Belanja lebih mudah, hidup lebih istimewa.">
  <title>NARA — Temukan Hal Favoritmu</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
  <script src="script.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="announcement">Gratis ongkir untuk pesanan pertama — <a href="#produk">belanja sekarang</a></div>

  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="brand" href="#" aria-label="NARA beranda">nara<span>.</span></a>
    <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Navigasi utama">
      <a href="#produk" class="nav-link active">Beranda</a>
      <a href="#produk" class="nav-link">Produk</a>
      <a href="#cerita" class="nav-link">Cerita kami</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="header-actions">
      <button class="icon-button search-toggle" aria-label="Cari produk" title="Cari produk">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.8" cy="10.8" r="6.8"></circle><path d="m16 16 4.5 4.5"></path></svg>
      </button>
      <button class="cart-button" id="cartButton" aria-label="Buka keranjang">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 4h2l2.2 11.1a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.6h8.9a2 2 0 0 0 1.9-1.5L22 8H6"></path><circle cx="10" cy="20" r="1"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="20" r="1"></circle></svg>
        <span>Keranjang</span><span class="cart-count" id="cartCount">0</span>
      </button>
      <button class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu" aria-label="Buka menu" aria-expanded="false">
        <span></span><span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> Pilihan kecil, cerita besar</p>
        <h1>Temukan hal<br>favorit <em>barumu.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-description">Koleksi pilihan untuk menemani keseharianmu. Dibuat dengan hati, dipilih khusus untukmu.</p>
        <a href="#produk" class="primary-button">Jelajahi koleksi <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <div class="hero-proof"><div class="avatar-stack"><span>R</span><span>A</span><span>D</span></div><p><strong>2.400+</strong> pelanggan bahagia</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1490481651871-ab68de25d43d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85" alt="Pilihan outfit dengan nuansa hangat">
        <div class="image-note"><span class="note-star">✳</span><span>Kurasi minggu ini<br><strong>Simple, but special.</strong></span></div>
        <span class="hero-index">01 / 04</span>
      </div>
      <span class="hero-decoration" aria-hidden="true">N</span>
    </section>

    <section class="benefits" aria-label="Keuntungan berbelanja">
      <div class="benefit"><span class="benefit-icon">✳</span><div><strong>Kurasi penuh perhatian</strong><span>Setiap produk punya cerita</span></div></div>
      <div class="benefit"><span class="benefit-icon">↗</span><div><strong>Pengiriman cepat</strong><span>Pesananmu segera meluncur</span></div></div>
      <div class="benefit"><span class="benefit-icon">♡</span><div><strong>Belanja tanpa khawatir</strong><span>Garansi tukar 7 hari</span></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="products-section" id="produk">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> Dipilih untukmu</p><h2>Favorit <em>minggu ini.</em></h2></div>
        <a href="#produk" class="text-link">Lihat semua <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="shop-controls">
        <div class="category-list" role="group" aria-label="Filter kategori">
          <button class="category-button selected" data-category="Semua">Semua</button>
          <button class="category-button" data-category="Fashion">Fashion</button>
          <button class="category-button" data-category="Aksesori">Aksesori</button>
          <button class="category-button" data-category="Lifestyle">Lifestyle</button>
        </div>
        <label class="search-box" id="searchBox">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.8" cy="10.8" r="6.8"></circle><path d="m16 16 4.5 4.5"></path></svg>
          <input type="search" id="searchInput" placeholder="Cari produk..." aria-label="Cari produk">
        </label>
      </div>
      <div class="product-grid" id="productGrid" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <p class="empty-state" id="emptyState" hidden>Produk tidak ditemukan. Coba kata kunci yang lain, ya.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="story-section" id="cerita">
      <div class="story-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441986300917-64674bd600d8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85" alt="Suasana toko NARA yang hangat"></div>
      <div class="story-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> Lebih dari sekadar belanja</p><h2>Hal baik dimulai<br>dari pilihan <em>kecil.</em></h2><p>Kami percaya barang yang tepat bisa membuat hari terasa lebih baik. Itulah kenapa setiap produk di NARA dipilih dengan cermat—supaya kamu bisa menemukan sesuatu yang benar-benar terasa seperti kamu.</p><a href="#produk" class="text-link">Kenali pilihan kami <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <a class="brand footer-brand" href="#">nara<span>.</span></a>
    <p>Temukan hal-hal kecil yang membuat hari lebih berarti.</p>
    <span>© 2025 NARA Studio</span>
  </footer>

  <div class="toast" id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <div class="cart-overlay" id="cartOverlay" aria-hidden="true">
    <button class="overlay-backdrop" id="closeCartBackdrop" aria-label="Tutup keranjang"></button>
    <aside class="cart-drawer" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="cartTitle">
      <div class="cart-heading"><h2 id="cartTitle">Keranjangmu <span id="drawerCount">(0)</span></h2><button class="close-cart" id="closeCart" aria-label="Tutup keranjang">×</button></div>
      <div class="cart-items" id="cartItems"></div>
      <div class="cart-empty" id="cartEmpty"><span>♡</span><p>Keranjangmu masih kosong.</p><button class="continue-shopping" id="continueShopping">Yuk, cari sesuatu yang kamu suka</button></div>
      <div class="cart-summary" id="cartSummary" hidden><div class="subtotal"><span>Subtotal</span><strong id="cartSubtotal">Rp0</strong></div><p>Ongkir dihitung saat checkout.</p><button class="checkout-button" id="checkoutButton">Lanjut ke checkout <span>↗</span></button></div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
